Z||000006||Raydar||06-29-2000||11:52 PM||||Gold 86SE, Great site!<BR>I enjoyed the Corvette killer article, too.<BR>I've also heard rumors that there was at least one Quad-4 running around in an aluminum space-frame Fiero. <BR>Back in the mid-late 80s, I heard a lot of comments to the effect of "The Fiero could put the Corvette on the trailer, with just a bit more development." <BR>Of course GM won't ever admit to that being the reason for the Fiero's demise. If you were in their position, would you?<P>Nivlek! Welcome aboard! <BR>We're all obsessed, and have way too much time on our hands. (At least that's what my wife says.)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <BR>||||reg||14
