Z||000013||Gold-86SE||06-30-2000||05:22 PM||||<BR>Wilburt, here is the information I need.<P>On page 1, I need:<BR>the torque for the 4-cylinder engine.<P>On page 3, under Replacement Parts, Cooling System, I need:<BR>Thermostat Housing Cap -[part number] <BR>Termostat Temp. Spec - [part number] <P>That is all, I think.<P>However, if I may make a request, since you have the book, may I get you to compare it with the information I have on my website?<P>The information can be found at the location specified above.<P>TIA<BR><P>------------------<BR>Gold-86SE (Fiero Collector)||||reg||1
